  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Was ist b?</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 12px;'>Der <strong>y-Achsenabschnitt b</strong> ist der Punkt, an dem die Gerade die y-Achse schneidet &ndash; also der Funktionswert bei x&nbsp;=&nbsp;0:</p><p style='text-align:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#d97706;margin:6px 0 12px;'>b = f(0) = m &middot; 0 + b = b</p><div style='display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 200 175' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:200px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;'><defs><marker id='ah' markerWidth='8' markerHeight='6' refX='6' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z' fill='#555'/></marker></defs><line x1='28' y1='160' x2='28' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='46' y1='160' x2='46' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='64' y1='160' x2='64' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='82' y1='160' x2='82' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='100' y1='160' x2='100' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='118' y1='160' x2='118' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='136' y1='160' x2='136' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='154' y1='160' x2='154' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='172' y1='160' x2='172' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='160' x2='172' y2='160' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='142' x2='172' y2='142' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='124' x2='172' y2='124' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='106' x2='172' y2='106' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='88' x2='172' y2='88' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='70' x2='172' y2='70' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='52' x2='172' y2='52' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='34' x2='172' y2='34' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='28' y1='16' x2='172' y2='16' stroke='#ececec' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='22.6' y1='88' x2='181' y2='88' stroke='#444' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah)'/><line x1='100' y1='165.4' x2='100' y2='7' stroke='#444' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah)'/><text x='28' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-4</text><text x='46' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-3</text><text x='64' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-2</text><text x='82' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-1</text><text x='118' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>1</text><text x='136' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>2</text><text x='154' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>3</text><text x='172' y='100' text-anchor='middle' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>4</text><text x='95' y='163' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-4</text><text x='95' y='145' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-3</text><text x='95' y='127' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-2</text><text x='95' y='109' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>-1</text><text x='95' y='73' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>1</text><text x='95' y='55' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>2</text><text x='95' y='37' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>3</text><text x='95' y='19' text-anchor='end' font-size='8' fill='#aaa'>4</text><text x='187' y='92' font-size='9' fill='#666'>x</text><text x='104' y='4' font-size='9' fill='#666'>y</text><line x1='46' y1='106' x2='136' y2='16' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='138' y='12' font-size='9' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='bold'>f</text><circle cx='100' cy='52' r='5' fill='#d97706' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='106' y='48' font-size='11' fill='#d97706' font-weight='700'>b = 2</text></svg><div style='flex:1;min-width:130px;'><div style='background:#fffbeb;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;'><strong>f(x) = x + 2</strong><br>&bull;&nbsp;x&nbsp;=&nbsp;0 einsetzen:<br>f(0)&nbsp;=&nbsp;0&nbsp;+&nbsp;2&nbsp;=&nbsp;<strong>2</strong><br>&bull;&nbsp;Die Gerade schneidet die y-Achse bei <strong>y&nbsp;=&nbsp;2</strong><br>&bull;&nbsp;b&nbsp;=&nbsp;<strong>2</strong></div></div></div><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:16px;'><strong>So bestimmst du b:</strong><br>&bull;&nbsp;Aus der Gleichung: b einfach ablesen &mdash; z.B. f(x)&nbsp;=&nbsp;3x&nbsp;+&nbsp;<strong>5</strong>&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp;b&nbsp;=&nbsp;5<br>&bull;&nbsp;Aus dem Graphen: Ablesen, bei welchem y-Wert die Gerade die y-Achse kreuzt<br>&bull;&nbsp;Durch Einsetzen: x&nbsp;=&nbsp;0 einsetzen und ausrechnen</div></div><div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgaben &ndash; Bestimme b</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>a)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>f(x) = 3x + 2</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>b)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>g(x) = &minus;x + 5</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='5' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>c)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>h(x) = 0,5x &minus; 3</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='-3' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>d)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 4px;'>Lies b aus dem Graphen oben ab:</p><p style='font-size:12px;color:#666;margin:0 0 10px;'>(f(x) = x + 2)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(14)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(14)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-14'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:2.2;'>a) f(x) = 3x + <strong>2</strong> &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; b = <strong>2</strong><br>b) g(x) = &minus;x + <strong>5</strong> &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; b = <strong>5</strong><br>c) h(x) = 0,5x &minus; 3 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; b = <strong>&minus;3</strong><br>d) Der Graph schneidet die y-Achse bei y = <strong>2</strong> &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; b = <strong>2</strong></p>"
}
